questions.question:
Schema:

enrollments(
  user_id   INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id),
  course_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES courses(id),
  ...
)

sqlite3 session on a copy of the database, using the same connection settings as the app:

sqlite> PRAGMA foreign_keys;
0
sqlite> DELETE FROM courses WHERE id = 21;
sqlite> SELECT COUNT(*) FROM enrollments WHERE course_id = 21;
38

Statement: "Had this connection run PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON before the DELETE, SQLite would have refused to delete course 21."
